'''Scourging Slayer''' is the upgraded form of [[Slayer]] using the [[Iolite]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use [[Iolite]], it has 10 additional [[Lightning|lightning damage]] and a 25% chance to apply [[Chain Lightning]].

* The primary attack is a wide 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* Its slower secondary attack is a thrust that deals 3x damage.

An upgraded Slayer will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Scourging Slayer.

